{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49431","headline":"临江仙 七 · 牛希济","name":"临江仙 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭波浪颭晴天，君山一点凝烟。\n此中真境属神仙。\n玉楼珠殿，相映月轮边。\n万里平湖秋色冷，星辰垂影参然。\n橘林霜重更红鲜。\n罗浮山下，有路暗相连。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛希济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49431.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49431","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}